usage: continental.py [-h] --config CONFIG --output OUTPUT [--gpu GPU]
                      [--smoke] [--dry-run]

Train the recovered continental-drift recipe and export its transport samples.
The notebook's referenced checkpoint is unavailable. This fresh recipe
preserves its native builder/trainer and printed settings; it is not a
reproduced figure.

optional arguments:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --config CONFIG  Explicit continental JSON recipe.
  --output OUTPUT  New result directory.
  --gpu GPU        One physical CUDA GPU index; required except for dry run.
  --smoke          Tiny execution check, not the recovered full experiment.
  --dry-run        Validate the recipe and data without importing JAX.
